# Tests the type of a division whose operands are integers and whose result is
# a whole number. doc/ref/spec.md makes it an integer: a result is a float only
# if it cannot be represented as an int or if an operand is a float.
# https://cuelang.org/issue/2649
-- in.cue --
(4 + 8 + 12) / 3
-- out/compile --
--- in.cue
{
  (((4 + 8) + 12) / 3)
}
